# Elspeth, Storm Slayer: "If one or more tokens would be created under your control, twice that many of those tokens are
# created instead" (CR 614.1a), so her +1 makes two 1/1 Soldiers (turn 1, on Black Lotus's white mana and two Moxen). Her 0 puts
# a +1/+1 counter on each creature and gives flying until her controller's next turn (turn 3); her -3 destroys Bot2's
# Tireless Tracker, a creature with mana value 3 (turn 5). Loyalty: 5 +1 = 6, 6 +0 = 6, 6 - 3 = 3.

